  "spans": {
    "sources": [],
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_index": 0,
        "span_id": "usr_f9df8342f6eb51af1b0fd17d",
        "start": 0,
        "end": 900,
        "text": "Add a `type=\"pills\"` variant to `st.tabs` to show tabs as pills\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the [existing issues](https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues) for similar feature requests.\n- [x] I added a descriptive title and summary to this issue.\n\n### Summary\n\nAdd a `type` parameter to `st.tabs` with a `\"pills\"` variant that renders the tab headers as pills (rounded, button-like segments) instead of the default underlined tab bar. Keep the same tab behavior — only the visual style of the tab headers changes.\n\n### Why?\n\nThe underlined tab style is great for section navigation, but pill-style tabs are a very common, more compact and prominent look — especially for filters, view switchers, and dashboards. Today users approximate this with `st.pills`/`st.segmented_control` plus manual conditional rendering, which is more boilerplate and doesn't give the clean container-per-tab"
      },
      {
        "message_index": 0,
        "span_id": "usr_df04fa420ff526bc9d8ee54a",
        "start": 900,
        "end": 1800,
        "text": " model that `st.tabs` provides.\n\n### How?\n\nAdd a `type` parameter (default preserves today's look):\n\n```python\ntab1, tab2, tab3 = st.tabs([\"Overview\", \"Details\", \"Settings\"], type=\"pills\")\nwith tab1:\n    st.write(\"...\")\n```\n\n- `type=\"default\"` (or `\"underline\"`) — current tab bar.\n- `type=\"pills\"` — render the tab headers as pills.\n- Everything else (content containers, active-tab state, etc.) stays identical.\n\n### Additional Context\n\n- Visually aligns `st.tabs` with the existing pill styling used by `st.pills` / `st.segmented_control`, but with the `st.tabs` container model.\n- Design references for the pills style:\n  - [Tailwind Plus — Tabs (pill variant)](https://tailwindcss.com/plus/ui-blocks/application-ui/navigation/tabs#component-2a66fc822e8ad55f59321825e5af0980)\n  - [Tremor — Tabs, solid variant](https://tremor.so/docs/ui/tabs#example-tabs-solid-variant)\n  - [Tremor — Tabs, stretc"
      },
      {
        "message_index": 0,
        "span_id": "usr_e9aed4eed52b01963a87b605",
        "start": 1800,
        "end": 1858,
        "text": "hed](https://tremor.so/docs/ui/tabs#example-streched-tabs)"
      }
    ]
  },
